  "body": "As part of [fetch-engine](https://github.com/phuu/fetch-engine), @ahume and I have run into the [guard](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-headers-guard) state of the [Headers](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#headers-class) object. We have some questions:\n- How is the guard initially set? There doesn't seem to be a parameter for it.\n- What does the external API for getting and setting the Headers' guard value look like?\n",
